    "Belay needs to read ~/.claude to tell when an agent is working. Nothing else is read, and nothing leaves this Mac.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Um zu erkennen, wann ein Agent arbeitet, liest Belay ~/.claude. Mehr wird nicht gelesen, und nichts verlässt diesen Mac."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay needs to read ~/.claude to tell when an agent is working. Nothing else is read, and nothing leaves this Mac."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Para saber cuándo trabaja un agente, Belay lee ~/.claude. No lee nada más y nada sale de este Mac."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour savoir quand un agent travaille, Belay lit ~/.claude. Rien d'autre n'est lu, et rien ne quitte ce Mac."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Per sapere quando un agente lavora, Belay legge ~/.claude. Non legge altro e nulla lascia questo Mac."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Чтобы понимать, когда агент работает, Belay читает ~/.claude. Больше он ничего не читает, и ничего не покидает этот Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Belay needs your permission to read %@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay braucht die Erlaubnis, %@ zu lesen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay needs permission to read %@."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay necesita permiso para leer %@."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Belay a besoin de votre autorisation pour lire %@."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay ha bisogno del permesso per leggere %@."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay нужно разрешение на чтение %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Belay reached its maximum awake time and stopped keeping your Mac awake.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay hat die maximale Wachzeit erreicht und lässt deinen Mac wieder schlafen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay reached the maximum awake time and let your Mac sleep."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay alcanzó el tiempo máximo despierto y dejó dormir el Mac."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay a atteint la durée d'éveil maximale et a laissé votre Mac se mettre en veille."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay ha raggiunto il tempo massimo di veglia e ha lasciato andare il Mac in stop."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay достиг максимального времени без сна и разрешил Mac уснуть."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Belay reached the longest stretch you allow it to hold, so it stopped.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Die maximale Wachzeit ist erreicht."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "The maximum awake time was reached."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Se alcanzó el tiempo máximo despierto."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Le temps d'éveil maximal est atteint."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Raggiunto il tempo massimo di veglia."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Достигнут предел времени без сна."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Belay reads only enough of your agent's session files to know whether it is running. Never your prompts, never your code, and nothing about you leaves this Mac. The one exception is the daily update check, which you can switch off.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay liest nur die Sitzungsdaten, die es braucht, um zu erkennen, ob ein Agent arbeitet. Deine Prompts und deinen Code liest es nie. Alles bleibt auf diesem Mac, außer der optionalen Update-Prüfung."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay reads only the session data it needs to tell whether an agent is working. It never reads your prompts or code. Everything stays on this Mac, except the optional update check."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay solo lee los datos de sesión que necesita para saber si un agente está trabajando. Nunca lee tus prompts ni tu código. Todo se queda en este Mac, salvo la comprobación opcional de actualizaciones."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay lit uniquement les données de session nécessaires pour savoir si un agent travaille. Il ne lit jamais vos prompts ni votre code. Tout reste sur ce Mac, sauf la vérification facultative des mises à jour."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay legge solo i dati di sessione necessari per capire se un agente sta lavorando. Non legge mai i tuoi prompt o il tuo codice. Tutto resta su questo Mac, tranne il controllo aggiornamenti facoltativo."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay читает только данные сессии, необходимые, чтобы понять, работает ли агент. Ваши промпты и код он не читает. Всё остаётся на этом Mac, кроме необязательной проверки обновлений."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Belay still works in Always on and Off modes": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "„Immer an“ und „Aus“ kannst du weiterhin verwenden."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can still use Always On or Off."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Puedes seguir usando «Siempre activo» o «Desactivado»."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous pouvez toujours utiliser « Toujours actif » ou « Désactivé »."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Puoi continuare a usare «Sempre attivo» o «Disattivato»."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Режимы «Всегда» и «Выключен» по-прежнему доступны."
          }
        }
      }
    },
